      "text": "Section 1. Any agency making an application for a State, Federal, Foundation or other grant shall submit a copy of such application to the Bureau of the Budget at the time the application is initiated. When the agency receives approval of such grant in the original or amended form, the agency shall notify the Bureau of the Budget by letter of such approval.",
